# Payload несёт секреты и персональные данные под естественными именами: слово PII — в любом месте имени, слитные
# формы и snake_case — тоже; факт (bool, число, время) и ID — нет.
rule: TestRootTypes
base: canon
want: internal/domain/shop/events.go: event ItemCreated carries SecretKey
want: internal/domain/shop/events.go: event ItemCreated carries TokenValue
want: internal/domain/shop/events.go: event ItemCreated carries PasswordPlain
want: internal/domain/shop/events.go: event ItemCreated carries AccessToken
want: internal/domain/shop/events.go: event ItemCreated carries EmailNormalized
want: internal/domain/shop/events.go: event ItemCreated carries PhoneE164
want: internal/domain/shop/events.go: event ItemCreated carries Username
want: internal/domain/shop/events.go: event ItemCreated carries Surname
want: internal/domain/shop/events.go: event ItemCreated carries EMail
want: internal/domain/shop/events.go: event ItemCreated carries owner_email
-- internal/domain/shop/events.go --
package shop

import "time"

const subjectItemCreated = "shop.events.item_created"

type ItemCreated struct {
	ID              string
	SecretKey       string
	TokenValue      string
	PasswordPlain   string
	AccessToken     string
	EmailNormalized string
	PhoneE164       string
	Username        string
	Surname         string
	EMail           string
	owner_email     string
	TokenID         string
	SecretRotated   bool
	At              time.Time
}
